      "all three direct baseline families complete",
      "R1 atomic advantage replicates on at least validation40 or official VOC and the other is not significantly reversed",
      "prediction-decision mismatch replicates on at least one independent split",
      "margin trend agrees on fit and at least one independent split",
      "representation, leakage, synthetic, claims, manuscript, and artifact requirements complete"
    ],
    "no_go": [
      "atomic advantage disappears or significantly reverses on both protected splits",
      "prediction-decision mismatch fails on both protected splits",
      "margin mechanism lacks directional consistency",
      "direct baseline specification is untrustworthy",
      "protected split is reused or tuned against",
      "the core claim cannot form a clear nine-page contribution"
    ]
